2026-10-02T14:00:12.258080Z TRACE codex_api::sse::responses: SSE event: {"type":"response.custom_tool_call_input.done","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport subprocess,pathlib,re\\nref='cba73b4dd836d0f50c4773cdf00fe2fc34cc9dc3'; base='4c22efe839a5a408b46840352943def280412784'\\nfor p in subprocess.check_output(['git','diff','--name-only',base,ref],text=True).splitlines():\\n text= subprocess.check_output(['git','show',ref+':'+p],text=True)\\n print(p)\\n for label,pat in [('zero',r'\\\\|\\\\|\\\\s*0\\\\b'),('catch',r'\\\\bcatch\\\\b'),('env',r'process\\\\.env|BYPASS|SKIP_'),('defaults',r'\\\\|\\\\||\\\\?\\\\?')]:\\n  hits=[str(i) for i,l in enumerate(text.splitlines(),1) if re.search(pat,l)]\\n  print(label+':'+','.join(hits))\\nPY\\nrg -n 'isHardReviewBoundaryError|EXECUTABLE_UNTRUSTED|executable_trust' trai_brain/mercury-bridge/{adversarial-review,ask,run-ledger}.js\",\"max_output_tokens\":2500}));\n","item_id":"ctc_[REDACTED]","output_index":1,"sequence_number":287}
